#. User interface: Messages.
#. Placeholders: ~LEAD~ = the active party member. The gender of these persons is unknown.
#. German: "~LEAD~ hat die Truhe aufgeschlossen."
#: AllTexts/Text.amb/Messages/079.txt
msgctxt "AllTexts/Text.amb/Messages/079"
msgid "~LEAD~ has unlocked the chest."
